    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-List Aisp Transactions-spec",
    "description": "The AISP Transaction Retrieval API allows users to access account transaction details from participating financial institutions. This API can be utilized by financial service providers and developers to fetch detailed records of transactions linked to an account, enhancing financial management and tracking processes. Typical use cases include providing consumers with insights into their spending patterns and supporting budgeting applications. The API leverages the capabilities of open banking to ensure secure and efficient transaction data retrieval.",
